==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Surge Base (Enemy Base)|Surge Base]].
*3 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sunfish Jones]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Red EnerG]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Mini Angel Cyclone]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**2 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
**2 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
While the Surge Base may look intimidating at first glance, the stage length and the fact that you want Surge Immune units anyways to handle the surplus of Surge enemies here means that it effectively does nothing but snipe the first meatshield in line. In addition, if you don't spawn too many cats before base hit, there's a good chance it will kill all your cats before they reach the enemy base, meaning you can save up to max base level / cash before releasing the boss wave.

The best way to clear this stage is to lure as always so that the Surge Base can't kill whatever non Surge Immune units you need to beat up the EnerG and Mini Angel Cyclone, like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]] and [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]]. [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]]'s powerful generalist stats and Surge means he can force constant damage knockbacks onto the Mini Angel Cyclone, while [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can land hits onto either the EnerG or Devil Wives and get explosive amounts of damage onto the frontline. With this amount of damage, it should be fairly easy to kill either EnerG, Mini Angel Cyclone, or both before Sunfish Jones can really do anything. From there, you can rely on Newtone and his Conjure to kill whatever peons may be left before dying to the Sunfish Jones, and from there simply spam Can Can and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]] to kill the Jones.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]], the stage width was set to 5,500. The change was made because of a bug in how [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|Animated Bases]] spawn when not set as bosses.

